          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩw’ai ũũ, inyw’ĩ athembi, na ĩthukĩĩsye, nyũmba ya Isilaeli, na tea kũtũ, nyũmba ya mũsumbĩ; nũndũ ũsilĩlo nũmwelekele; nũndũ mũtw’ĩkĩte kĩtei ku Misiva, na kĩtei kyalanĩtw’e ĩũlũ wa Tavoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
